WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Narrator: Two moments.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.500
Narrator: A man pushes in.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Majed: Hey! Back!

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Narrator: Majed shouts and blocks him - and the queue gets angry.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Faisal: Welcome. Everyone here is waiting for the same match - the queue starts just there. Thank you.

6
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Man: No. I'm staying here.

7
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Narrator: Faisal stays calm, explains it's fair for everyone, and when the man refuses, he doesn't argue - he tells his supervisor.

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.000
Narrator: Then a delay.

9
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Noura: The scanners are slow. About ten minutes. Thank you for your patience - you will be in before kick-off.

10
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:51.500
Narrator: Noura tells everyone what's happening and how long. Information keeps people calm.

